OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys come forward to police
OL,4,Aover library blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 12-year-old boys have come forward
OL,7,Fto police after a fi redestroyed a
OL,8,Fformer library.
OL,10,FBillingham's old Roseberry Library, at
OL,11,Fthe back of Billingham Health Centre on
OL,12,FQueensway, was spotted burning at about
OL,13,F18:20 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe blaze caused significant damage to
OL,16,Fthe building and disruption to nearby
OL,17,Fshops, businesses and residents with
OL,18,Fseveral road closures in place as fire
OL,19,Fcrews battled the flames.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
