OL,3,GNEWSATwo boys come forward to police
OL,4,Aover library blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police said the two boys came
OL,7,Fforward voluntarily on Thursday and
OL,8,Fhave been interviewed by detectives. A
OL,9,F14-year-old boy who was arrested on
OL,10,Fsuspicion of arson on Wednesday has
OL,11,Fbeen bailed while investigations
OL,12,Fcontinue.
